data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,s\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (closed-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (omega-sequence predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedUnion}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedUnion}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (indexed-union predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7FSigmaSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7FSigmaSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}f\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7FSigmaSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,s(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedUnion}_S(A,s,\\omega)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}f\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop7FSigmaSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\exists s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,s(n))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedUnion}_S(A,s,\\omega)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witnessing closed family is a set-coded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequence, and its union is expressed by the canonical indexed-union predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union","status":"resolved","id":"3a78929818a246ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-indexed-union]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetIndexedUnion}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7FSigmaSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\te